WEBVTT

00:00:00.002 --> 00:00:04.469
Turn a training question
into a Coach Conversation.

00:00:04.469 --> 00:00:09.300
Say what you want
to work on.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:13.527
Choose someone in your club,
or leave it for any coach.

00:00:13.527 --> 00:00:17.534
Request the conversation.

00:00:17.534 --> 00:00:20.723
The request stays here
with your follow-up conversation.
